    <data key="d0">Alef Education Machine Learning Recommendation Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dp3YAxFp-YM</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for personalized e-learning recommendations combining streaming data ingestion, data warehousing, Kubeflow training on EKS, SageMaker hyperparameter tuning, ECR container storage, and auto-scaled EKS inferencing.</data>
    <data key="d3">Machine Learning, Analytics &amp; Big Data, Compute, Containers</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
